sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Server
    C->>S: TCP SYN
    S-->>C: SYN-ACK
    C->>S: ACK
    C->>S: ClientHello: versions, ciphers, key share, SNI
    S-->>C: ServerHello + key share
    S-->>C: Certificate, CertificateVerify, Finished (encrypted)
    Note over C: Verify chain, hostname, expiry
    C->>S: Finished (encrypted)
    C->>S: HTTP request over TLS 1.3
    S-->>C: HTTP response
